    "long_instructions": "*This level follows a video that you may have watched with your class. If you missed the video, you can watch it in the Help and Tips tab of this level.*\r\n\r\n# Debug: Missing Paragraph\r\n\r\nSomeone has submitted a bug report on this web page. Can you fix the bug?\r\n\r\n![](https://images.code.org/4692981592c07e166945a4037b73c680-image-1767512171987.png)\r\n\r\n# Do this\r\n\r\n1) Find and fix the problem that is causing the bug",
